&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Win new enterprise logos for the leading Pentest as a Service platform. This is a hunter role: your primary mandate is opening and closing net-new accounts across US - North Central, with a secondary responsibility to expand within our install base. You will sell scoped, human-led pentesting to CISOs, AppSec leaders, and engineering buyers, backed by our vetted Cobalt Core community and a platform that gets customers testing in as little as 24 hours.&lt;/p&gt;
