&lt;li&gt;Build and run an outbound-led pipeline engine in your territory, combining targeted prospecting, executive outreach, events, and partner-sourced opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research target accounts to identify triggers (compliance deadlines, audits, M&amp;amp;A, new product launches, security leadership changes) and map buying centers across security, product, IT, and engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multi-thread new accounts from first meeting to close, navigating procurement, legal, and security review in complex organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run discovery that ties pentesting to business drivers such as SOC 2, PCI, HIPAA, customer security questionnaires, and secure SDLC goals, then lead scoping conversations that convert to a first engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate and close enterprise agreements, structuring initial credit commitments that create a path to expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet prospects in person across the region (25% travel) to build trust and advance deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expansion within the install base&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Customer Success to identify expansion opportunities in existing accounts: additional assets, new business units, and larger credit commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive renewals and upsell by connecting engagement results and finding trends to customer risk priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Across the territory&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute territory and account plans that prioritize regulated industries (e.g., financial services, healthcare, and insurance), as well as manufacturing and SaaS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Solutions Architects, Customer Success, and Channel Partners to create value at every stage of the customer lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecast accurately and maintain rigorous pipeline hygiene in Salesforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Must Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of enterprise sales experience in SaaS or cybersecurity, with a proven new logo acquisition track record as the core of your background (required).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success sourcing your own pipeline through outbound prospecting, not just working inbound or inherited accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A record of meeting or exceeding quota, with a majority of attainment from net-new business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience closing complex, multi-stakeholder deals with $100K+ ACVs and 90-180 day sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling to CISOs, AppSec leaders, or engineering buyers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to expand and renew within an install base while keeping new logo as your priority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Residence within the territory (or willingness to be based there).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have: experience selling pentesting, AppSec, or compliance-driven security (SOC 2, PCI, HIPAA).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious, accountable, and collaborative. You adopt tools like automation, AI, and data insights to sell more effectively, and you take ownership of your number.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
