&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cobalt is looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Growth Marketing Manager &lt;/strong&gt;to join our marketing team. This isn&#39;t a traditional demand gen role. We are building a sophisticated Growth Marketing framework that is focused on automation and orchestration to identify accounts with the highest propensity to buy, and nurture them into turning purchase ready.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will develop and execute integrated marketing playbooks and measure the efficacy of the programs on regular cadences. With the goal of generating and accelerating pipeline across North America and EMEA regions, you will leverage your experience to build systems that are scaleable, repeatable and sustainable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With tight alignment with Sales and Revenue Operations teams, you will utilize Salesforce, UserGems, HubSpot to identify intent and track buyer movement, in support of both new business and expansion pipeline. You are accountable, fearless in taking ownership, and ready to move beyond &quot;lead gen&quot; to innovate programs across the entire customer journey.&lt;/p&gt;
